                        "glosses": [
                            "A large, extinct, carnivorous dinosaur of genus †Spinosaurus, with a long snout like that of a crocodile and with a sail on its back. It is considered to be the largest theropod dinosaur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
