                                "sense_id": "fad4693b-e017-3c9f-a2de-6e76b793226a",
                                "text": "The first spinosaurus remains were discovered in Egypt in 1911, but they were destroyed in 1944 during World War II. A lot of what is known about spinosauruses comes from skull material found in Morocco and Algeria in later years."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
